post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
This package installs `t3code` (desktop app) and `t3` (server).

The server keeps the shape `t3 serve` had before: same base directory (~/.t3),
same default port (3773), so existing pairings keep working.

A launcher from an older standalone install can still shadow `/usr/bin/t3`, as
`~/.local/bin` comes first on PATH. Where one exists, repoint it:

  ln -sfn /usr/bin/t3 ~/.local/bin/t3

`t3 update` and `t3 uninstall` refuse on a package-managed install; rebuild and
reinstall this package instead.
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  cat <<'EOF'
Restart the running server so it picks up the new binary.
EOF
}
